{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Search for the eye drops in the monster's guts.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a little eye in search of eye drops who finds himself on two legs in a threatening and twisted environment, completely hand-drawn with vivid and gruesome details.<br>Get ready to scurry around facing all kinds of creatures inside a colossal dying beast that is trying to communicate with you.<br>Will you be able to understand what lies within it and untangle the maze of guts that awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/4bca96e6c446e31daf894c0746eb81f8.poster.avif?t=1773824067\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/4bca96e6c446e31daf894c0746eb81f8.webm?t=1773824067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/4bca96e6c446e31daf894c0746eb81f8.mp4?t=1773824067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple and intuitive 2D combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk, jump, and strike in simple and intuitive 2D combat that guarantees extreme responsiveness to controls.<br>Use physics to your advantage to solve puzzles, kill enemies, and progress through the adventure in unconventional ways!<br>With the right creativity, every element in the environment can be exploited in original ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/7bdc4c0930d98d54c890e35d51ec582f.poster.avif?t=1773824067\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/7bdc4c0930d98d54c890e35d51ec582f.webm?t=1773824067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every element is an opportunity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use every object to your advantage by fusing it with your body to become bigger, stronger, faster, and acquire special abilities that could lead you to reevaluate your surroundings, unlocking new paths and passages.<br>More than 100 unique objects and 4 weapons to fuse them with will allow you to interact with the world in a unique and original way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/7bdc4c0930d98d54c890e35d51ec582f.poster.avif?t=1773824067\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/7bdc4c0930d98d54c890e35d51ec582f.webm?t=1773824067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A unique and intriguing environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the gigantic creature and its insides, including flesh, teeth, unknown tissues, organs of dubious usefulness, and paradoxical corridors... all completely hand-drawn by a single person!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/3f6f694ba161cf02edf932969ae7aef0.poster.avif?t=1773824067\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/3f6f694ba161cf02edf932969ae7aef0.webm?t=1773824067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/extras/3f6f694ba161cf02edf932969ae7aef0.mp4?t=1773824067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Creator's room awaits you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own levels using a very simple and intuitive editor designed specifically so that anyone can express themselves.<br>Create the most difficult thing a player has ever seen or a level of unique beauty and share it with your friends or via Steamworks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world that blends a unique and visceral atmosphere with a creative and emerging gameplay system, where every step forward deepens the mystery of your own existence.<br>Every encounter is an opportunity to evolve both externally and internally!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is not recommended for individuals with epilepsy or epileptic seizures.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560430?t=1773824067","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560430?t=1773824067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/50db938164246ecef951bb99b426435749d41ffb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773824067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560430/50db938164246ecef951bb99b426435749d41ffb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773824067","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3809560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Search for the eye drops in the monster's guts.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a little eye in search of eye drops who finds himself on